Implements the first executable slice of #47.

- add `CausalTopology.as_of()` with explicit `observed_at` and `event_time` views;
- preserve edges and attractor descriptors only for visible nodes;
- add longitudinal metadata to `TerrainSnapshot` (`observed_at`, `window_policy`, `topology_version`);
