- isolates HOME/XDG config and removes known provider credentials/endpoints;
- syscall-fences AF_INET/AF_INET6 sockets plus `socket.create_connection`, so any hidden network/provider fallback fails the package smoke;
- runs a real canonical Prolog greeting and requires `providers_enabled=false`, `max_provider_calls=0`, `max_model_calls=0`, `provider_calls=0`, and `model_calls=0` with exact integer zero and renderer `symbolic-dcg/v1`;
- bounds wheel construction to 120s and the installed-layout symbolic smoke to 30s so a packaging/runtime regression fails instead of wedging the fleet lane.

This is packaging/install evidence only. Durable multi-turn state remains owned by merged #1264 and the active #1342/#1347 evidence work; Android natural-turn semantics remain in #1282; final Desktop+Android transcript acceptance remains #1254.

